Building Peter's 3-layer AI architecture ("GigResource IQ™"). Every AI tool can run at 3 levels: **Starter** (no AI, DIY form), **Semi** (assists, user approves), **Maximum** (full draft prepared). Three layers stack: **Layer 1** admin master switch (already built — `AiToolSetting` + `AiToolCatalog::disabledKeys()` + admin UI) → **Layer 2** membership (which level a user unlocks) → **Layer 3** the tool actually behaving differently per level.

**Business rule (Peter's zero-users launch strategy):** membership tiers apply ONLY to PROFESSIONALS (Starter=Core=Manual, Professional=Pro-Grow=Manual+Semi, Elite/enterprise=Elite=Manual+Semi+Maximum). CLIENTS & INFLUENCERS get every level FREE at launch (capped later by usage quotas, not tier). Monetize clients/influencers at 1000 clients / 500 influencers.

**Phase 1 DONE (commit 67011aa):**
- `config/ai-levels.php` — single source: `plan_levels` (starter/professional/enterprise → level arrays), `professional_default`=['manual'], `free_roles`=[client,influencer], `tool_modes` (per AiToolCatalog key → supported levels; auto-capable tools get maximum, advisory tools cap at semi), `labels`/`descriptions`.
- `app/Domain/AiFeatures/AiAccess.php` — resolver. `level(?User,$toolKey)` → none|manual|semi|maximum (highest available). `unlockedLevels(User)`, `can(User,$toolKey,$minLevel)`, `label($level)`. Logic: admin-disabled tool → none; `AI_FEATURES_FREE_FOR_ALL` env or admin → all; `activeRole()==='supplier'` → plan's levels (default manual); else (client/influencer) → all free. **GOTCHA fixed:** null plan slug made `config("ai-levels.plan_levels.{$slug}")` return the whole array — guard with `$slug ? ... : null`.
- AI tools hub (`resources/views/ai-tools/index.blade.php`) shows a colour-coded level badge per tool (`.akt-lvl` / `lvl-manual|semi|maximum|none`).
- **NOTE:** `.env` has `AI_FEATURES_FREE_FOR_ALL=true` (launch/UAT — everyone gets Maximum). Flip to `false` to activate real tier gating. Verified with flag off: Starter/no-plan pro=Manual, Professional=Semi, Elite=Maximum, client/influencer=Maximum.

**Phase 2 DONE (commit 9e5b532) — first Layer-3 tool = AI Package Builder** (`AiPackageBuilderController` + `resources/views/ai-tools/package-builder.blade.php`): `show()` resolves `$level` and passes it; view renders 3 experiences (Manual=plain form+Save, Semi=form + per-field ✨ helpers, Maximum=Auto-Generate Full Package). `compute()` is action-aware (`full`/`price`/`description`/`addons`) and server-gated (`AiAccess::can` — semi actions need semi+, full needs maximum). **Admin demo override: `?preview=manual|semi|maximum`** on the tool URL (admins only) — use this to demo all 3 without switching accounts. All verified live.

**Existing pre-built infra this builds on:** `AiFeatureGate` + `AiFeatureUsage` (usage metering / monthly quotas), `AiFeatureCode` (3 codes so far: ai.budget_allocator/vendor_matchmaking/review_writer), `MembershipPlanSeeder` (plans starter/professional/enterprise with per-feature quotas + comments Manual/Semi/Maximum), `User::aiFeatureAccess()`/`activeSubscription()`.

