## memory/bsr-bidding-workflow.md

---
name: bsr-bidding-workflow
description: "APPROVED 2026-07-27: the broadcast bidding flow becomes its own process named BSR (Bidding Service Request), separate from SSR/MSR/ESR/Direct Offer. 8 client+pro screens first, Admin bidding-window settings as a later phase."
metadata: 
  node_type: memory
