## memory/workflows-master-spec.md

---
name: workflows-master-spec
description: "Canonical GigResource lifecycle spec (Peter's ~48-workflow set, reconciled 07.15.2026) + the big post-event architecture fix + open conflicts. Read before building any client/pro request/booking flow."
metadata: 
  node_type: memory
  type: project
